---
title: "C15 — Load a consistent board · Implemented"
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant V as List view
  participant Q as Generated query options
  participant A as API
  V->>Q: Load selected list scope
  par Status-dependent task pages
    Q->>A: Read resolved statuses
    A-->>Q: Resolved statuses with version
    Q->>Q: Validate status response
    Q->>A: First task page per resolved status, in parallel
    A-->>Q: Task pages with configuration versions
  and Effective fields
    Q->>A: Read resolved fields
    A-->>Q: Resolved fields with version
  end
  Q->>Q: Validate scope and matching versions
  alt Consistent bundle
    Q-->>V: Render columns and cards
  else Mixed or stale bundle
    Q->>A: Restart bounded bundle load
    alt Repeated conflict
      Q-->>V: Recoverable retry state
    end
  end
